---
source: crates/langmeld-syntax/tests/corpus/main.rs
expression: report
---
errors.txt: one missing value gives one error: expected failure
expressions.txt: calls and groups nest inside each other: expected failure
generics.txt: nested generics close with two angle brackets: expected failure
literals.txt: float with a negative exponent: expected failure
literals.txt: hexadecimal with underscores: expected failure
literals.txt: character in single quotes: expected failure
names.txt: keyword used as a name: expected failure
operators.txt: unary minus right after an assignment: expected failure
operators.txt: unary minus right after not-equal: expected failure
operators.txt: shift right: expected failure
